commit c732bd71ec1f2fb40b4b84e50e8b1ee0f6c348d2
Author: Wallace Chan <naahtec@hotmail.com>
Date:   Tue Jun 9 20:06:02 2026 -0400

    skill: #11144 Iter 35 — G7 close: strip L2 config gate, harness probe = sole decider
    
    Operator: strip the config gate (recommended per AGENT-RUNTIME §2).
    
    The boot block had four sub-steps:
      1. Verify GitHub Issues access
      2. Determine wake mode from config (the config gate)
      3. Check harness reachability (event-mode candidate only)
      4. EVENT mode contract load OR POLLING mode block
    
    Step 2 contradicted AGENT-RUNTIME §2 ("the harness probe IS the mode
    selector"). Composed CLAUDE.md even carried a > Note callout admitting
    the contradiction and naming the long-term plan to retire the config
    gate. G7 closes that plan: strip Step 2 + the Note callout; promote
    the harness probe from a conditional step to the universal mode-selector
    per §2.
    
    Source edit (1 block in references/roles/instructions.md):
    - Removed `#### Determine wake mode from config` heading + 4-bullet
      config check + the > Note callout (10 source lines)
    - Renamed `#### Check harness reachability (event-mode candidate only)`
      → `#### Check harness reachability`; rewrote the lede paragraph to
      cite AGENT-RUNTIME §2 directly
    
    Backward compat: zero behavior change for existing installs.
    `config.py` already silently defaults missing `event-driven:` values
    to polling (per the retired Note callout's own statement). Installs
    that had `event-driven: yes` set explicitly: still get event mode IF
    the harness is reachable (harness probe never changed); fall through
    to polling otherwise (same as before).
    
    Composed-output deltas:
    - dm:    722 → 711 (−11)
    - pm:    763 → 752 (−11)
    - qa:    716 → 705 (−11)
    - skill: 872 → 861 (−11)
    
    Closes: G7 (L2 Step 1 config gate vs §2 harness-probe-only).
    
    Remaining: G9 (19 inactive L3 files), G10 (statusline label coupling),
    G11 (boot-bootstrap.md source divergence).

diff --git a/.squidsquad/dm/CLAUDE.linked.md b/.squidsquad/dm/CLAUDE.linked.md
